   "stem": {
      "text": "Let f(x) = x^3 - x^2 + 4. The line tangent to the graph of f at the point where x = -1 is y = L(x). Which of the following is L(x)?"
   },
   "answer_key": {
      "form": "symbolic",
      "mathjson": [
         "Add",
